kr7B26mhEQq.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ezbrL1dMymKQZw7mDEWa2ZTzN7d.jpg\",\"rating\":9,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Avatar Aang, the world's last Airbender, learns of an ancient power that could save his culture from extinction. With the help of his friends, he embarks on a global quest to find it before it falls into the wrong hands and threatens to upend the peace they sacrificed everything to achieve.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":980477,\"title\":\"Ne Zha 2\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fcs5AdCKliQaQgXsPS9kDejamIJ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gd9kxeEEONj5SECs4GA8Ddn3czI.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After a catastrophic event leaves their bodies destroyed, Ne Zha and Ao Bing are granted a fragile second chance at life. As tensions rise between the dragon clans and celestial forces, the two must undergo a series of perilous trials that will test their bond, challenge their identities, and decide the fate of both mortals and immortals.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Action\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":82702,\"title\":\"How to Train Your Dragon 2\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/d13Uj86LdbDLrfDoHR5aDOFYyJC.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8AAuJtCzaibYkbE0QVHc8EBsELB.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Five years after uniting the dragons and Vikings of Berk, Hiccup and Toothless soar beyond their homeland, charting the vast unknown. During one of their adventures, the pair discover a secret cave that houses hundreds of wild dragons—and a mysterious dragon rider with a startling connection to Hiccup. And as the ruthless conqueror Drago Bludvist rises to seize control of both dragons and people alike, Hiccup must step into his role as a true leader and, alongside his friends and Toothless, protect Berk from a devastating war.\",\"genres\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Action\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":81188,\"title\":\"Rise of the Guardians\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yfzmfWGjcmyugH6FZ13WcsUGiNj.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/46IGtYNjpIvQYRIQlb2X493Wh8x.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"year\":2012,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Generation after generation, immortal Guardians have protected the world's children from darkness and despair. But when the malicious boogeyman Pitch Black schemes to overthrow the Guardians by obliterating children’s innocent beliefs in them, the Guardians must join forces for the first time to protect the hopes and imagination of children all over the earth.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Animation\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":527774,\"title\":\"Raya and the Last Dragon\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5nVhgCzxKbK47OLIKxCR1syulOn.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zmX7ObPaRfiCmY6LMalUb1bJDKj.jpg\",\"rating\":7.8,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Long ago, in the fantasy world of Kumandra, humans and dragons lived together in harmony. But when an evil force threatened the land, the dragons sacrificed themselves to save humanity. Now, 500 years later, that same evil has returned and it’s up to a lone warrior, Raya, to track down the legendary last dragon to restore the fractured land and its divided people.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Action\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":620249,\"title\":\"The Legend of Hei\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nWdES36hGwADWWBGzvgT1Z3Xn86.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/niMCrXNVxEYXHSeQU0GPos0vdED.jpg\",\"rating\":8.4,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When cat spirit Luo Xiaohei's home is deforested by humans, he must find a new one. He runs into a group of other spirit creatures who take him under their wing with dreams of reconquering the land they say is rightfully theirs. However, they run into a human known as Wuxian who separates Luo Xiaohei from the other spirits and the two go on a journey, with the cat spirit learning to control his abilities as well as forming his own thoughts on whether or not he should ally with the spirits or the humans.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Fantasy\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1147416,\"title\":\"Miraculous World: London, at the Edge of Time\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6AtoMpHvs9pxd30KsyK8QmJ9W9M.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cBTwQKMd7Vn6rGTGBtoFLIfj7uM.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"To save the future from a terrible fate, Marinette becomes Chronobug and teams up with Bunnyx to defeat a mysterious opponent who travels through time.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Family\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":839033,\"title\":\"The Lord of the Rings: The War of the Rohirrim\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/23WCoDo6wzBfzbX7BGTNwVUqZfi.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ie8OSgIHEl6yQiGJ90dsyBWOpQA.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A sudden attack by Wulf, a clever and traitorous lord of Rohan seeking vengeance for the death of his father, forces Helm Hammerhand, the King of Rohan, and his people to make a daring last stand in the ancient stronghold of the Hornburg.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Fantasy\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":560057,\"title\":\"The Sea Beast\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9Zfv4Ap1e8eKOYnZPtYaWhLkk0d.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wUwizGzbTk5CTiKBnE4Pq1MONwD.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When a young girl stows away on the ship of a legendary sea monster hunter, they launch an epic journey into uncharted waters — and make history to boot.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Adventure\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":14411,\"title\":\"Sinbad: Legend of the Seven Seas\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yiW2L1fDiBT7AeWXrykhTNtPrr8.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/j8isWEPL3PmmVh8ap3jm75qVF4p.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2003,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The sailor of legend is framed by the goddess Eris for the theft of the Book of Peace, and must travel to her realm at the end of the world to retrieve it and save the life of his childhood friend Prince Proteus.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Animation\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":663113,\"title\":\"Patalliro! The Movie\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qR17ndNiqh3hvlzSG9PEoI7M1rD.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hSqDOIXckuDCLSudWJxYBMDJ8Ah.jpg\",\"rating\":9,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Patalliro du Malyner VIII is the crown prince of Malynera, a kingdom that produces diamonds. Despite being ugly and mischievous, he is loyal and fair. Many enemies of the throne, including Malynera's Prime Minister, plan to get rid of him and take control of the rich nation. Patalliro, however, has the protection of Jack Barbarosa Bancoran, his haughty and extremely handsome bodyguard, who will protect him even from the latter's own lover, the beautiful bishonen hitman Maraich Juschenfe and other assassins.\",\"genres\":[\"Music\",\"Adventure\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":22076,\"title\":\"Alien Hunter\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cb58aaGnPJROoooFCXlR6o1ebw5.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hWTqjvMryjtCLMxo90iSqZ89tT4.jpg\",\"rating\":5.1,\"year\":2003,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Government agents find evidence of extraterrestrial life at the South Pole.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Action\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"Xq3fTk_9xfc\",\"name\":\"Attack On Titan: Wings Of Freedom - Official Trailer (In Cinemas 1 Oct 2015)\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}